Subject: [PATCH] Claude A: Task A25 - fix Key=null/Mod=null bang thuat toan
 baseline V6_TOAN_PRO

ROOT CAUSE (chung minh bang so, khong doan mo): Musical Content Gate cu
(MUSICAL_CONTENT_MIN_ENERGY=0.08, tinh tren nang luong FFT peak-picking +
spectral whitening) CHAN DUNG ca 1 hop am sach/full volume tong hop
(frameAvgEnergy do duoc = 0.033, duoi nguong 0.08). Vi hasMusicalContent
luon false, chromaVector KHONG BAO GIO duoc cap nhat -> estimateKeyFromChroma()
luon tra confidence=0 (gated) -> runVoteLoop luon reject vi < MIN_CONFIDENCE
-> vote window khong bao gio day -> Key khong bao gio chot -> Mod (phu
thuoc 100% vao KeyEngine.estimateKeyFromChroma().confidence) cung khong
bao gio chay theo. Day la nguyen nhan DUY NHAT cua ca Key=null va Mod=null
(1 diem hong duy nhat, khong phai 2 loi rieng biet).

FIX (chi sua ui/js/engines/keyEngine.js, KHONG dung modEngine.js/
renderer.js/ui/index.html/MIDI/BPM/ManualState/ManualPriorityGuard/
PluginController - dung pham vi task yeu cau):

Lay V6_TOAN_PRO (Extension/content.js) lam baseline, CHUYEN thuat toan
sang kien truc AUTO_MENU_AI (khong copy mu quang):

1. Chroma extraction: thay "FFT peak-picking + spectral whitening +
   harmonic suppression" bang NNLS-style harmonic-template (duyet 88 phim
   piano MIDI 21-108, cong nang luong 8 harmonic dau tien noi suy tuyen
   tinh tu FFT bin gan nhat, nhan HARMONIC_AMP giam dan) - mo hinh hoa
   dung cach nhac cu/giong hat that tao overtone.

2. Musical Content Gate: thay nguong nang luong tho bang RMS tren toan
   dai 50-6000Hz (V6 baseline), CO SUA THEM: khong loai bo bin nen khoi
   tong/dem (phat hien qua MarginEngine.verify.js - mot tin hieu that
   nhung it dinh pho ro rang bi chan nham voi cach loc bin nen + doi hoi
   toi thieu 20 bin "noi bat", da kiem chung bang so: 6 dinh -10dB giua
   nen -100dB van cho RMS~0.024, gap 48 lan nguong, trong khi im lang that
   cho RMS~1e-5, thap hon nguong 50 lan - nguong van phan biet dung).

3. Profile: thay Krumhansl-Kessler 1990 goc bang profile V6
   (Krumhansl-Temperley + Albrecht-Shanahan, tuned cho nhac pop/karaoke
   Viet Nam).

4. Scoring: thay Pearson correlation bang cosine similarity tren chroma
   da nen power-law (^0.67) + L2-normalize (V6 baseline) - nhay hon voi
   chroma vector thua (nhieu pitch-class=0), tinh huong rat thuong gap
   voi nhac that.

GIU NGUYEN 100% (kien truc AUTO_MENU_AI, khong dung): vote-window,
VOTE_MIN_AGREE, Adaptive Lock, Stability Tracker, Confidence V2, Margin
Logger/Engine, Telemetry, dual-rate smoothing (chromaVector/
chromaVectorFast), bass-root-voting boost (BASS_ROOT_BOOST_WEIGHT - V6
khong co, AUTO_MENU_AI tu them de phan biet giong song song), toan bo
public API (init/detectOnce/watchContinuous/stop/onLevel/
onProvisionalEstimate/estimateKeyFromChroma/getDebugSnapshot/
shortestSemitoneDelta/NOTE_NAMES/MIN_CONFIDENCE) - renderer.js/modEngine.js
KHONG can sua gi.

VERIFIED (jsdom + vm sandbox, chay THAT ui/js/engines/keyEngine.js +
modEngine.js trich xuat nguyen van, khong phai code mo phong rieng, tren
tin hieu am thanh tong hop THAT qua FFT Radix-2 that - PCM voi harmonic
giong nhac cu/giong hat that, khong phai sine don thuan):

- C Major, A Minor, D Minor, D#/Eb Minor: nhan dung root + Major/Minor o
  nhieu muc am luong (100%, 33%, ca 5%).
- Nhieu nen thuan tuy: hasMusicalContent dung false (khong bao gio bao co
  tin hieu gia).
- detectOnce() end-to-end: CHOT duoc Key sau 15.0s (san vote-window, vi
  margin tren 1 hop am tinh/khong doi thap hon nguong Adaptive Lock
  0.80 - nhac that co giai dieu bien doi lien tuc se hoi tu nhanh hon,
  ca V6 goc cung can nhieu frame lien tuc de hoi tu Bayesian voi tin hieu
  tinh khong doi, xem so sanh truc tiep V6 vs AUTO_MENU_AI trong bao cao).
- MOD end-to-end (dung modEngine.js that, khong sua gi): giu D Minor 5s ->
  chuyen sang Eb Minor -> onModulation() bao chinh xac
  {semitone:1, originalKey:"D", targetKey:"D# Minor", stable:true} -
  DUNG VI DU Khoi da nay ra (Chay ve noi phia anh - D Minor -> Eb Minor).

VE MOD - lam ro theo yeu cau Khoi: modEngine.js hien tai da dung dung y
nghia can co (phat hien modulation THAT SU xay ra trong bai hat, bao thoi
gian + tone dich cho Key xu ly, KHONG dung nghia "MOD tay" - phan Manual
Mod/set tone bang tay giu nguyen KHONG DUNG). Display Khoi mo ta (thoi
gian + tone can len) da co san trong updateModInfo()/#modTime/#modStatus
tu truoc (renderer.js, KHONG sua trong task nay) - chi la KHONG BAO GIO
chay duoc vi phu thuoc KeyEngine, gio da tu hoat dong dung sau fix nay.

Regression: 0 NEW FAIL. Bat ngo tich cuc: 7 test TUNG fail tu truoc A20
(ConfidenceV2, KeyEngineV2, MarginLogger, ModEngineV2, StabilityTracker,
TelemetryLogger, Top1StabilityTimer) nay TU PASS - vi tat ca deu kiem tra
tinh nhat quan noi tai cua keyEngine.js THAT, ma truoc day luon degenerate
(chromaVector toan so 0) nen luon fail; gio thuat toan cho ket qua that,
cac test nay tu nhien pass. Phat hien 1 regression thuc su trong luc sua
(MarginEngine.verify.js) - da sua ngay (xem muc 2), khong che giau.

NOT RUN - GIOI HAN MOI TRUONG: audio thuc/WASAPI Loopback that/Studio One
that (sandbox khong co Windows/audio hardware). Da bu bang tin hieu tong
hop qua FFT that (khong phai gia dinh/doan) chay dung code that trong
keyEngine.js/modEngine.js - day la bang chung gan nhat co the tao duoc
trong moi truong hien tai, KHONG thay the duoc test tren nhac that/Windows
that.
